{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9b583c04a8f09026","type":"text","text":"解决方案：一个解决方案里面可以有哦多个TwinCAT工程","x":340,"y":-1280,"width":490,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1ed2ed78eb3942a2","type":"text","text":"什么叫做“**实时**”：意思就是说，要在指定时间里面完成任务\n同理“**实时系统**”，就是说一整套能够在指定时间里完成任务的环境系统","x":940,"y":-1160,"width":500,"height":120},
		{"id":"9844faf3c15a7152","type":"text","text":"系统：\n- 实时任务与任务周期\n- CPU 核心分配\n- 路由和目标控制器连接\n- 授权许可证\n- 系统启动、同步与实时性设置","x":340,"y":-1158,"width":250,"height":237,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8c007f29720e99eb","type":"text","text":"运动控制：\n配置伺服轴、编码器、轴组和 CNC 等运动控制功能。","x":340,"y":-850,"width":260,"height":93,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2798f7fad91ce76e","type":"text","text":"**CNC**:Computer Numerical Contorl计算机数字控制\n说白了就是让计算机调节多个轴在某个范围内走多少多少的范围","x":1012,"y":-885,"width":248,"height":185},
		{"id":"d5cec826db5dc179","type":"text","text":"PLC：\n就是用来编写程序的核心模块","x":296,"y":-669,"width":284,"height":89,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"71f66071769a747d","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260716134609.png","x":676,"y":-624,"width":400,"height":329},
		{"id":"c6ed8538201afac0","type":"text","text":"**PLC**:一个PLC里面可以创建多个project","x":1700,"y":-652,"width":331,"height":56},
		{"id":"18c3e997376154db","type":"text","text":"**Reference**:就是库，相当于C语言里的各种头文件放的地方","x":1700,"y":-596,"width":326,"height":56},
		{"id":"a066a35d2757d491","type":"text","text":"**Data_Unit_Type**：就是叫做自定义数据类型\n这里面给你提供的就有，\n- 结构体 `STRUCT`\n- 枚举 `ENUM`\n- 联合体 `UNION`\n- 类型别名\n- 自定义数组类型","x":1689,"y":-525,"width":250,"height":265},
		{"id":"bc39686936a3d28f","type":"text","text":"**Global_Variable_List**全局变量列表，就是在里面整全局变量，可以被多个程序访问\nVAR_GLOBAL\n    bMachineStart : BOOL;\n    bEmergencyStop : BOOL;\n    nProductCount : DINT;\nEND_VAR","x":1700,"y":-252,"width":340,"height":232},
		{"id":"5a6e4271ea930a4e","type":"text","text":"PLC\n└─ Untitled1                    PLC 工程容器\n   ├─ Untitled1项目             PLC 源代码项目\n   │  ├─ References             库引用\n   │  ├─ DUTs                   自定义数据类型\n   │  ├─ GVLs                   全局变量\n   │  ├─ POUs                   程序、功能块和函数\n   │  ├─ VISUs                  可视化界面\n   │  └─ PlcTask (PlcTask)      PLC 执行任务\n   └─ Untitled1 Instance        PLC 运行实例","x":1090,"y":-157,"width":350,"height":274},
		{"id":"a2b8ed7f5eebb107","type":"text","text":"**Program Organization Unit** 程序组织单元，就是编写主程序的地方 ","x":1700,"y":-20,"width":331,"height":89},
		{"id":"35cea3a6f76b9719","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260716141701.png","x":2160,"y":-53,"width":399,"height":244},
		{"id":"29cc8f26fc4568e5","type":"text","text":"**Visualization**就是PLC的可视化","x":1656,"y":162,"width":304,"height":60},
		{"id":"7881dc2e7d6dcc81","type":"text","text":"**PlcTask**就是任务","x":1651,"y":287,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"58404bb61d583b38","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260716112205.png","x":-520,"y":-1039,"width":400,"height":313,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"dfec570a1fc6ad43","type":"text","text":"是工程师用来编写代码的语言，由于他的逻辑性比较强，普通的软件工程师都可以借助这个代码进行编写","x":-180,"y":20,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"9e76ac34a6de8622","type":"text","text":"ST（Structured Text）","x":-680,"y":50,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"}
	],
